# Project

- Stack: React 19 + TypeScript UI, FastAPI backend, SQLite, Docker, SAM2.1 Hiera Small. No CVAT at runtime.
- Ports: UI `8092`, API `8091` (`/docs`). Data volume `annotator-data`. Model cache `sam2-models`.
- Before changing persistence, SAM2, tracking, or exports, read `doc/architecture.md`. Operational rules: `AGENTS.md`.
- Implement the agreed plan. Do not silently redesign. Do not delete Docker volumes.
- Use Mercurial unless the user asks for git. Commit only when asked.
